# Raw Pol.is exports (repo-root data/ only): contain participant-level vote
# rows, so they stay out of the public repo. Only the aggregated
# site-data/*.json is committed. See src/site/geneva-reflections/README.md.
# The leading slash matters: a bare "data/" also matches nested directories
# like src/site/<page>/data/, which silently dropped the Geneva data sub-page
# from the repo (production 404).
/data/
